        "procedure": "Compounds 1–3 were obtained by reaction of Ln(tmhd)3·2H2O (0.025 mmol; Ln = Gd for 1) and HL1 (0.025 mmol) in a mixture of 8 mL acetonitrile and 4 mL dichloromethane. The solution was sealed in a 20 mL vial and heated at 70 °C for 24 h, then cooled slowly to room temperature. Yellow block-shaped crystals suitable for single-crystal X-ray diffraction were isolated. Yield 68% based on HL1.",
